    {
      "caption": "P(event) = favourable ÷ total",
      "duration_ms": 7000,
      "id": "s3",
      "narration": "For a single event, the probability is the number of favourable outcomes divided by the total number of possible outcomes. Heads on a fair coin: one favourable, two possible.",
